#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:1
msgid "E4222"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `invalid_lexscan_target`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`invalid_lexscan_target`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:5
msgid "Invalid lexical matching target."
msgstr "无效的词法匹配目标。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:7
msgid ""
"`lexmatch` accepts an in-memory `String`, `StringView`, `Bytes`, or "
"`BytesView`. `lexscan` accepts an in-memory `@lexbuf.StringScanner`, a "
"synchronous `@lexbuf.Lexbuf`, or an asynchronous `@lexbuf.AsyncLexbuf`. A"
" `String` or `StringView` value is not a valid `lexscan` target; use "
"`lexmatch` for one in-memory match, or construct a `StringScanner` to "
"maintain a cursor between scans. Other values, such as numbers or user-"
"defined lexbuf-like types, cannot be matched by these expressions."
msgstr "`lexmatch` 接受内存中的 `String`、`StringView`、`Bytes` 或 `BytesView`。`lexscan` 接受内存中的 `@lexbuf.StringScanner`、同步的 `@lexbuf.Lexbuf` 或异步的 `@lexbuf.AsyncLexbuf`。`String` 或 `StringView` 不是合法的 `lexscan` 目标；单次内存匹配使用 `lexmatch`，需要在多次扫描间维护游标时则构造 `StringScanner`。这些表达式不接受数字或用户定义的类似 lexbuf 的类型等其他值。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:15
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:17
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn scan_text(text : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexscan text with longest {\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:21
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:24
msgid ""
"Use `lexmatch` with text or bytes, or create a `StringScanner`, `Lexbuf`,"
" or `AsyncLexbuf` for `lexscan`."
msgstr "对文本或字节使用 `lexmatch`，或构造 `StringScanner`、`Lexbuf`、`AsyncLexbuf` 供 `lexscan` 使用。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4222.md:26
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn match_text(text : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  lexmatch text with longest {\n"
"    _ => ()\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
